66
00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:46.480
Mis on raadio top Kredo?
Kredo on meelelahutus,

67
00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.179
sellepärast et viimane aeg on
Eestimaale

68
00:04:48.279 --> 00:04:50.820
